	(text "PN532 DIP: 1=ON 2=OFF (I2C), addr 0x24.\nShares the bus with RTC 0x51, IMU 0x6B;\nmodule has the I2C pull-ups."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 233.68 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "058db25d-478d-4ee7-b11a-2015bf20a4f0")
	)
	(text "Rev A changes vs. carrier-netlist.net draft (review 2026-10-06)\n- IO15 sense: TPS3808G01 (U2, C3) replaces R1/R2 100k/47k; R2 now 11k3.\n- R8 4k7 bleeder on VIN_FUSED.\n- JP1 bridged by default (D1 bypassed); D1 only matters in fallback.\n- J5 is Molex PicoBlade 53261-0271 (module J1 is \"PH1.25\" = MX1.25).\nFirmware: IO7 high first in app_main; IO15 falling = power lost;\nin the halt loop, IO15 high again -> esp_restart().\nKeep the module microSD slot empty or 1-bit: IO15 is its D2 line."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1568770a-5115-4813-a04e-f777ba355aec")
	)
	(text "2 x 5 F / 2.7 V in series = 2.5 F, 5.4 V. Charged to 4.2 V by\nthe module ETA6098 through J5. Hold-up ~5-7 s, backlight off.\nSupercaps only: no LiPo on the module (car interior temps)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 137.16 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "17f68943-304e-4d49-9d72-2015f1d400ae")
	)
	(text "Fallback (DNP): open JP1 and JP2, unplug J5, fit R3 + D2."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 152.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "26aaa852-daf9-4256-9060-8d2636575100")
	)
	(text "6  Mounting (M2.5, 8 mm standoffs)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 177.8 198.12 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "33ade32d-4f39-4da8-9246-b5eee3a74026")
	)
	(text "2  Power-loss sense -> IO15 (PWR_SENSE)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 177.8 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "3c2c3014-66cd-45fe-b707-14459464f310")
	)
	(text "3  Supercap hold-up bank (on module J1 BAT)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 106.68 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "459bf54b-6882-4bbb-9019-9c1a20cc4e49")
	)
	(text "Supervisor runs from the module 3V3 (held up by the\nsupercaps), so ~RESET stays actively low after the car\nport is gone. Open drain; the module R30 10k pull-up\non IO15 is the pull-up.\nTrip: 0.405 V x (1 + 100k/11k3) = 3.99 V falling.\n~RESET released 20 ms after VIN_FUSED > 4.0 V (CT open).\nReplaces the rev A 100k/47k divider, which read HIGH\nwith the car on or off because of R30."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 177.8 71.12 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6e1a4a53-5328-4a73-98d6-be29911c0c4a")
	)
	(text "5  PN532 reader and debug UART"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 198.12 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6f5fd661-538d-441f-899e-44403256a1aa")
	)
	(text "R8 bleeds VIN_FUSED to 0 V once the car\nport dies (~1 mA at 5 V): clean sense edge.\nJP1 bridged by default: D1 drop + PTC +\ncable would leave < 4.5 V (ETA6098 min in)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 116.84 78.74 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "73cd74c1-a69a-43bb-a533-aa0947cdb121")
	)
	(text "Same-side (type A) SH cable, pin 1 to pin 1.\nAll module current + up to 2 A of charge current\npass J8 pin 2 (one SH contact, ~1 A rated):\nset the module ETA6098 RISET (R7) to >= 200k."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 241.3 162.56 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7539fb1a-cd04-4c56-82de-f612fa9a290a")
	)
	(text "module J8\n 1  GND\n 2  USB_5V (in)\n 3  D- / IO19   n/c\n 4  D+ / IO20   n/c\n 5  GND\n 6  3V3 (out)\n 7  SCL / IO10\n 8  SDA / IO11\n 9  TXD / IO43\n10  RXD / IO44\n11  GPIO18 (R35 10k pull-up)\n12  GPIO15 (R30 10k pull-up)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 241.3 119.38 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "89041cbc-44ba-4f33-96ca-80a425979840")
	)
	(text "1  Car 5 V input, protection, D1 isolation"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 20.32 0)
		(effects
